<html> <head> <title>ISFDB Title/Author/Year/Series/Index Search</title></head>
<body bgcolor="ffffff">
<h1>ISFDB Title/Author/Year/Series/Index Search</h1>

<p>
<form method="POST" action="http://DBASELOC/search.cgi">

<hr>
Perform a database search for an <b>author</b>, <b>title</b>,
or <b>series</b> substring. The <b>year</b> option displays
all entries alphabetically by category for a given year. The
<b>index</b> option displays all fiction for a given year, 
and is sorted by author. Search matches are caseless, and 
spaces are honored.
<p>
<b>
  Enter Term:
</b>

<input name="arg">
<select name="type">
  <option selected>Name
  <option>Title
  <option>Year
  <option>Series
  <option>Index
</select>

<p>
<input type="submit" value="Submit Query">
<input type="reset" value="Clear Form"><p>

</form>

